# Campaign map source art — full-resolution originals (A0 posters, Photoshop
# files) live locally only; they are too large to version here. The derived
# hex data under data/maps/*.json IS tracked and is what the application reads.
# A web-sized map image intended for the app belongs in a served asset
# directory, not here.
data/**/*.jpg
data/**/*.jpeg
data/**/*.png
data/**/*.tif
data/**/*.tiff
data/**/*.psd
data/**/*.psb
